# Regenerable invariant-matrix caches (~5 MB each).  Rebuild with
#   python3 scripts/gen2/invmatrix.py A
#   python3 scripts/gen2/invmatrix.py B
# The database itself (connected_n2_n9.g6) and the R4 gate record
# (crossval_ok.json) are durable and are NOT ignored: population.json records the
# sha256 of the graph6 file, and generate2.py refuses to run without the gate.
*.npz
